{% comment %}
369 Art Collective - About Content Section
{% endcomment %}

<section class="about-content">
  <div class="about-content__container">
    
    <div class="about-section">
      <h2 class="about-section__title">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="about-section__text">
        369 Art Collective is an artist-powered marketplace that puts creators first. We believe artists deserve fair compensation and complete creative control. Our platform combines premium print-on-demand technology with automated royalty payments, enabling artists to focus on what they do best: creating amazing art.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <h2 class="about-section__title">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__number">01</div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Artists Upload</h3>
          <p class="about-card__text">Creators submit their artwork to our platform. Each piece is reviewed for quality and originality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__number">02</div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">We Produce</h3>
          <p class="about-card__text">Approved artwork is automatically converted into premium print products using Printify's global network.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__number">03</div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Customers Buy</h3>
          <p class="about-card__text">Art lovers purchase prints with confidence knowing they're supporting independent artists directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__number">04</div>
          <h3 class="about-card__title">Artists Earn</h3>
          <p class="about-card__text">Automated royalty system ensures artists receive 30-45% of every sale, paid via Stripe Connect.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <h2 class="about-section__title">Why 369 Art Collective?</h2>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li><strong>Fair Royalties:</strong> Artists earn 30-45% per sale, with recruitment and referral bonuses</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Inventory:</strong> Print-on-demand means no upfront costs or storage hassles</li>
        <li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Products ship worldwide through Printify's fulfillment network</li>
        <li><strong>Premium Quality:</strong> Museum-grade paper, vibrant colors, professional finishes</li>
        <li><strong>Automated Payouts:</strong> Stripe Connect handles payments securely and efficiently</li>
        <li><strong>Artist Community:</strong> Join a network of creators supporting each other's growth</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about-content {
  background: #fff;
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
}

.about-content__container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.about-section {
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.about-section__title {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #0f0f0f;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.about-section__text {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #4a5568;
  max-width: 800px;
}

.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
}

.about-card {
  background: #f7f8f9;
  padding: 2rem;
  border-radius: 16px;
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.about-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}

.about-card__number {
  font-size: 3rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #6366f1;
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  opacity: 0.3;
}

.about-card__title {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #0f0f0f;
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
}

.about-card__text {
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #6b7280;
  margin: 0;
}

.about-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 2rem 0 0;
}

.about-list li {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #4a5568;
  padding: 0.75rem 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
}

.about-list li:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.about-list strong {
  color: #0f0f0f;
  font-weight: 700;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-content {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-section__title {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "247 About Content",
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "247 About Content"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
